e":"〖1〗四年：天纪四年（公元 280）。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":529,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-ce3554cdfa6d4a10d8dc","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命。惟垂信纳，以济元元〖11〗。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":195},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-surrender","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见。﹝四﹞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45},{"id":"atlas-close-q-wu-year","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-6d9d569aba82d35ae0c8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，立中山、代等十一王〖2〗。大赦。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":520,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23},{"id":"major-proof-q-wu-letter","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"天纪四年，晋军征皓；皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":44,"end":78},{"id":"santizhu-q-5e1ac8597c6e78a9cfc7","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c76b27d961ba7e5c15ed","layer":"original","quote":"（壬申）〔三月壬寅〕〖12〗，王濬最先到；于是受皓之降，解缚焚榇〖13〗，延请相见","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41},{"id":"santizhu-q-e4e74308393a35a22bc8","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-494ea68636e86f3566e3","layer":"original","quote":"而王濬顺流将至，司马伷、王浑皆临近境。皓用光禄勋薛莹、中书令胡冲等计〖7〗，分遣使，奉书于濬、伷、浑曰：“昔汉室失统，九州分裂；先人因时，略有江南；遂分阻山川，与魏乖隔。今大晋龙兴，德覆四海；暗劣偷安，未喻天命。至于今者，猥烦六军；衡盖路次〖8〗，远临江渚。举国震惶，假息漏刻〖9〗；敢缘天朝，含弘光大。谨遣私署太常张夔等〖10〗，奉所佩印绶，委质请命","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":176},{"id":"shiyi-q-0e770c595f6580abfa17","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-4fc67ac4f1e860e46f7e","layer":"original","quote":"天纪中，为中书令","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":29},{"id":"shiyi-q-238ab7e53e4812bbcbbc","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-311393558e1b31a8ac7d","layer":"pei","quote":"冲，后仕晋，尚书郎，吴郡太守","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1c51e9a99f41b9a7e4b5","start":10,"end":24},{"id":"shiyi-q-37c4d34d2c62361be6ee","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-4fc67ac4f1e860e46f7e","layer":"original","quote":"子冲嗣","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":7,"end":10},{"id":"shiyi-q-9d8cdb5e4386d72009e9","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-4fc67ac4f1e860e46f7e","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌六年，卒。子冲嗣。冲平和有文干〖9〗。天纪中，为中书令。﹝一﹞","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33},{"id":"shiyi-q-dcb8e2a46512a585a898","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-4fc67ac4f1e860e46f7e","layer":"original","quote":"冲平和有文干","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":17},{"id":"zhangyan-q-b86fc7f04034d2681027","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-2039c8cd73aadf4de2e9","layer":"original","quote":"皓奉书于司马伷、王浑、王濬请降：其文，莹所造也","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":54,"end":77}],"profiles":{},"director